B.dKz=new A.mo("battery","Battery","\ud83d\udd0b",B.bi,"Pushes electric charge round a loop. Tap it to change how many volts it has. More volts means a stronger push.","Two different metals sit in a chemical paste. The chemicals swap electrons between the metals, and that makes a voltage.")
B.dKB=new A.mo("solar","Solar panel","\u2600\ufe0f",B.cS,"Makes electricity from light, with no battery. Use the light slider: more sunshine means more volts.","Slices of silicon. When light hits them it knocks electrons loose, and a layer on each side pushes them one way.")
B.dKM=new A.mo("crank","Hand crank","\ud83d\udd04",B.d8,"A generator you turn by hand. Tap it again and again: the faster you spin it, the more volts it makes.","A magnet spins inside a coil of copper wire. A moving magnet pushes electrons along the wire. This is how an alternator or dynamo works.")
B.dKG=new A.mo("turbine","Wind turbine","\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f",B.b_,"A generator turned by the wind. Change the wind strength to change the volts.","Blades catch the wind and turn a shaft joined to a generator, the same coil-and-magnet idea as a dynamo.")
B.dKD=new A.mo("switch","Switch","\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f",B.bD,"Opens or closes the loop. Electricity only flows round a closed loop. Tap it to flip it.","Two metal contacts. Flipping the lever makes them touch, or pulls them apart.")
B.dKN=new A.mo("fuse","Fuse","\ud83e\uddef",B.cI,"A safety part. If too much current flows, its thin wire melts and the loop breaks, which stops fires.","A very thin strip of metal inside a glass tube. It heats up and melts when the current is too high.")
B.dKy=new A.mo("pot","Dimmer knob","\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f",B.hL,"A resistor you can change. Turn it to let less or more current through, like a volume control.","A strip of resistive material with a sliding contact that touches it at different places.")
B.dKJ=new A.mo("resistor","Resistor","\u3030\ufe0f",B.aI,"Holds back the current, which protects other parts. Tap it to change its size in ohms.","A tiny rod of carbon or a thin metal film, with coloured stripes that tell you its ohms.")
B.dKK=new A.mo("bulb","Light bulb","\ud83d\udca1",B.io,"Glows when current heats its thin wire. It is made for 3 volts. Much more and it burns out!","A very thin coil of tungsten wire in a glass bulb with no air, so it can glow white hot without burning.")
B.dKC=new A.mo("led","LED","\ud83d\udd34",B.aH,"A light that uses very little power. It only works one way round, and it burns out without a resistor to protect it.","A tiny chip of special crystal. When electrons cross the join in the chip they give off light.")
B.dKE=new A.mo("motor","Motor","\u2699\ufe0f",B.bL,"Turns electricity into spinning. More current spins it faster. It is the reverse of a generator.","Coils of wire become magnets when current flows, and they push and pull against fixed magnets to make a shaft turn.")
B.dKI=new A.mo("buzzer","Buzzer","\ud83d\udd14",B.c7,"Makes a sound when current flows through it.","A thin metal disc is pulled and released many times a second by electric pulses. That shakes the air as sound.")
B.dKA=new A.mo("heater","Heater","\ud83d\udd25",B.d8,"Turns electricity into heat. Toasters and kettles work like this. More power makes it glow hotter.","A long coil of special wire that resists the current. The current has to push through it, and that makes it hot.")
B.dKH=new A.mo("capacitor","Capacitor","\ud83e\udeab",B.cE,"Stores electric charge like a tiny rechargeable tank. It fills up from a battery, then can give the charge back.","Two sheets of metal foil, rolled up with a thin plastic sheet between them.")
B.dKF=new A.mo("radio","Radio","\ud83d\udcfb",B.l5,"Needs about 3 volts or more. When it has power it picks up stations and plays them.","An aerial catches invisible radio waves. A tuner picks one station, and a chip turns it back into sound for the speaker.")
B.dKL=new A.mo("tv","TV","\ud83d\udcfa",B.bc,"Needs about 6 volts or more. With power it shows a picture made of millions of tiny coloured dots.","Millions of tiny red, green and blue lights, called pixels, that glow at different strengths to make every colour.")
